Description: wait asynchronously for SSC publication on the QRTR bus
 On a cold boot the DSP can publish SSC after the initial bus lookup.
 Watch existing and newly announced nodes for SSC while the main context
 processes QRTR events. Bound discovery to 30 seconds and wake the same
 context on cancellation.
Forwarded: no
